[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="LookPreset" format=3]
; The first drawn look with its light drawn in crosshatching on the world and the pilgrim alike: faces in plain light clean, shade and shadow hatched, crossed in the darks; brush strokes through the paint; the pilgrim's lit side hatched in pale lines out of its black.

